- **Breaking change:** Removed the schedule endpoints deprecated since Fleet 4.35: `/api/v1/fleet/global/schedule`, `/api/v1/fleet/global/schedule/:id`, `/api/latest/fleet/schedule`, `/api/latest/fleet/schedule/:id`, `/api/v1/fleet/fleets/:fleet_id/schedule`, and `/api/v1/fleet/fleets/:fleet_id/schedule/:report_id`. They now return `410 Gone` with a link to the Fleet 5 migration guide. Schedule reports with the reports endpoints instead by setting `interval`, `platform`, `min_osquery_version`, and `logging` on the report.
